' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Sequence diagrams: included after _style.puml.
'
' A sequence diagram is scaled to the text width, so what decides
' its legibility is how much drawing surrounds each word. Three
' settings keep that small:
'   * long message labels wrap, so the lifelines stay close;
'   * the text is larger than in the other diagrams, because the
'     gaps between lifelines and the box padding do not grow with
'     it, so a larger font raises the share of the figure that is
'     text;
'   * the participants are not repeated at the bottom.
' Do not add ParticipantPadding: PlantUML prints a warning banner
' into the image instead of applying it.
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
skinparam maxMessageSize 205
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 15
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantFontSize 16
}
skinparam note {
  FontSize 14
}
hide footbox
